# R8 rules for the minified release build.
#
# Verified 2026-09-09 (#260 item 2): R8 DOES read this path. A deliberately
# unparseable directive here failed :app:minifyReleaseWithR8 with
# 'Unknown option', naming this file and line. The AGP 9 keepRules source-set
# convention is wired; rules added here will take effect.

# security-crypto drags in Tink, which references annotation types it does not
# bundle (errorprone annotations) and the JSR-305 concurrency/nullable
# annotations (javax.annotation.*). None of that is retained in a release APK
# -- it is only referenced from Tink's signatures -- so the classes are
# legitimately absent. These are exactly the lines R8 emitted in
# build/outputs/mapping/release/missing_rules.txt; adding the classes instead
# would only bloat the APK with annotation stubs.
-dontwarn com.google.errorprone.annotations.CanIgnoreReturnValue
-dontwarn com.google.errorprone.annotations.CheckReturnValue
-dontwarn com.google.errorprone.annotations.Immutable
-dontwarn com.google.errorprone.annotations.RestrictedApi
-dontwarn javax.annotation.Nullable
-dontwarn javax.annotation.concurrent.GuardedBy
